<title>FRANCE: Generale sees debt reduction from Cinven deal.</title>
<headline>Generale sees debt reduction from Cinven deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>French conglomerate Generale des Eaux will reduuce its debt by close to seven billion francs as a result of its deal to sell its health activities to Cinven Ltd of Britain, a group spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
